# Generated meshes and renders. Everything here is rebuilt in seconds by
# ./build.sh, and the STLs run to hundreds of megabytes, so they stay out of
# the repo. The .scad wrappers and dice/manifest.json are kept: together they
# are the exact record of what every die carries.
